---
description: Routing — client docs vs agent rules
alwaysApply: false
---

Agent: choose human-facing `docs/` vs scoped `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.

- System behavior, SLAs, topology — `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Self-hosted product — `docs/SELF_HOSTED.md`
- Protection and trust — `docs/PROTECTION.md`, `docs/TELEMETRY_AND_TRUST.md`
- Data security — `docs/runbooks/DATA_SECURITY.md`
- Local dev, CI, open work — `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`
- Multi-region design — `.cursor/MULTI_REGION.md`
- Compliance control matrix — `.cursor/COMPLIANCE_MATRIX.md`
- Engineering rules — `.cursor/rules/guidelines-index.mdc` + scoped `*.mdc` (cold path: `cold-path.mdc`)

Do not duplicate agent rules into `docs/`.
